            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A valved needle assembly 10 includes a connector 46 having an inner hole 77, a pipe body 44 fixed to a tip end of the connector 46, a valve body 16, and an assembly part 50 in which an insertion part 46a provided to one of the connector 46 and the pipe body 44 is inserted into another such that the connector 46 is disposed within or about the pipe body 44. A locking protrusion 66 and a locking part 105 are provided to superposed faces 48a, 49a of the connector 46 and the pipe body 44 in the assembly part 50 for preventing the insertion part 46a from dislodgment by mutual lock, and an inclined guide surface 57 for guiding the locking protrusion 66 is formed on a tip end in a direction of assembly of the connector 46 or the pipe body 44 to which the locking part 105 is provided. The valve body 16 is incorporated by being mated with the connector 46 and the pipe body 44.</p>
            </abstract>
